<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.6125 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.6125 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.6125 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6140 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 28		  Oct 25</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6125		  4.6140</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    200,000		 50,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
